        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Choose your reference in Load Audio. The SAME audio feeds Whisper and Drama 3.\n2. Load Whisper (mtb) uses the full large checkpoint in models/whisper/whisper-large. download_missing=False disables downloads.\n3. Audio To Text (mtb) transcribes the reference. Its first STRING output feeds reference_text, NOT text.\n4. Write the NEW words to generate in the Drama 3 text field.\nlanguage=auto detects the reference language; select fr to force French. Timestamps are disabled.\nWhisper Model Loader (WanVideoWrapper) supplies video-conditioning features, not a transcript. Timing nodes and Whisper to Text (LLM Ready) are not needed here.\nTo wire reference_text manually: right-click Drama 3 > Convert Widget to Input > reference_text.\nAfter updating Python nodes, fully restart ComfyUI, then reload this workflow. Refreshing the browser alone does not load new node code.\nThe runtime uses your install.ps1 configuration (runtime.json). If max_frames=0 is rejected or a blank runtime resolves to the ComfyUI directory, restart ComfyUI to load the updated node."
      ],
