        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "DIRECTION FIELD - paste one example:\nwarm, conversational, relaxed pace\ncalm narrator, clear diction, measured pace\nexcited, playful, energetic\nsad, restrained, speaking softly\nangry, tense, firm delivery\n\nTEXT FIELD - cues next to the words to speak:\n[warm] It is good to see you again.\n[amused] You really did that?\n[angry] I asked you to wait!\n<whisper>Keep this between us.</whisper>\n\nUse direction for delivery across the generated parts; use inline cues to guide individual lines. Speech language follows the text, so these cues can also accompany French, Spanish or Italian dialogue.\nreference_text contains only the words actually spoken in the reference clip. Put new delivery instructions in direction or text. Cue strength varies with the reference and model output."
      ]
